WEBVTT

00:04.851 --> 00:05.851
<b>Yes.</b>

00:06.481 --> 00:10.691
<b>I have a feeling a golden temple will
be built somewhere within sight of here.</b>

00:10.781 --> 00:13.741
<b>Yeah, I know what you mean.
You can sort of feel it, can't you?</b>

00:13.821 --> 00:15.861
<b>There's no way
they'd build something like that.</b>

00:15.951 --> 00:17.241
<b>THE GOLDEN PAVILION
DOES NOT YET EXIST</b>

00:17.321 --> 00:19.491
<b>We have been greatly indebted to Mima.</b>

00:20.161 --> 00:22.251
<b>I must thank her properly later.</b>

00:22.751 --> 00:26.711
<b>Still, to think that her father
is Doyo Sasaki.</b>

00:28.091 --> 00:32.051
<b><i>He betrayed Kamakura alongside Takauji,</i></b>

00:32.131 --> 00:34.511
<b><i>and I hear that he now serves
as something of a strategist</i></b>

00:34.591 --> 00:35.841
<b><i>for Takauji in Kyo.</i></b>

00:37.761 --> 00:43.641
<b>My Lord, if you command me to do so,
I will use her to get close to Doyo</b>

00:44.181 --> 00:46.851
<b>and make preparations
to take Takauji's head.</b>

00:49.401 --> 00:51.481
<b>Let's not. It would put you in danger,</b>

00:51.571 --> 00:54.491
<b>and I don't want to betray her
when she has treated us as friends.</b>

00:55.201 --> 00:58.281
<b>I want this one encounter
to end with us remaining good friends.</b>

00:59.701 --> 01:01.741
<b>Forgive me for making
such an insensitive proposal.</b>

01:03.121 --> 01:04.911
<b>That is just like you, My Lord.</b>

01:24.811 --> 01:29.481
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

02:37.921 --> 02:40.801
<b>So, what do you two like about the boy?</b>

02:40.881 --> 02:42.301
<b>-He's kind.
-He's kind.</b>

02:43.721 --> 02:47.221
<b>You country girls are always so quick
to fall back on kindness.</b>

02:47.811 --> 02:51.521
<b>Listen. A man who gives you
no excitement is worthless.</b>

02:51.601 --> 02:55.231
<b>There must be moments
when even the boy gives you a thrill.</b>

02:58.941 --> 03:03.201
<b>See? In the end, it's that thrilling side
of him you're attracted to.</b>

03:03.281 --> 03:05.371
<b>-Mima!
-You're too loud!</b>

03:05.451 --> 03:07.041
<b>Boy!</b>

03:07.121 --> 03:08.541
<b>Wait a second!</b>

03:08.621 --> 03:11.421
<b>After all that,
they really have become friends.</b>

03:11.501 --> 03:13.041
<b>They sure are carefree.</b>

03:14.131 --> 03:17.591
<b>Still, even after spending days
traveling around Kyo,</b>

03:17.671 --> 03:20.171
<b>all we hear are terrible things
about the Emperor.</b>

03:20.261 --> 03:23.471
<b>Yes. The warriors, in particular,
are full of discontent.</b>

03:23.551 --> 03:27.011
<b>My father said
the Emperor is far more capable</b>

03:27.101 --> 03:28.271
<b>than he needs to be.</b>

03:29.731 --> 03:33.521
<b><i>That's why he cannot understand
how ordinary or incompetent people feel,</i></b>

03:33.601 --> 03:35.611
<b><i>and he wants to decide everything
by himself.</i></b>

03:36.151 --> 03:38.691
<b><i>He said that if only the Emperor
had just one wise retainer</i></b>

03:38.781 --> 03:44.321
<b><i>who understood both him and the people,
he could have become a true hero.</i></b>

03:47.161 --> 03:48.411
<b>See you, boy.</b>

03:48.491 --> 03:49.951
<b>Yeah. Thank you.</b>

03:50.041 --> 03:51.161
<b>I had fun again today.</b>

03:56.131 --> 03:57.131
<b>Hey.</b>

03:58.961 --> 04:00.631
<b>How long are you staying in Kyo?</b>

04:02.721 --> 04:06.391
<b>I don't know. I have a feeling
I may not be here much longer.</b>

04:07.721 --> 04:08.811
<b>Hey…</b>

04:09.471 --> 04:11.771
<b>Would you consider serving my father?</b>

04:11.851 --> 04:15.941
<b>You could rise much higher in rank
than you would as a guard in Suwa.</b>

04:18.361 --> 04:20.531
<b>SAIONJI MAIN RESIDENCE</b>

04:20.591 --> 04:23.761
<b>CARPENTER
TEAM FOREHEAD</b>

04:20.611 --> 04:23.761
<b>Chojumaru! Just the person I needed!</b>

04:23.781 --> 04:26.411
<b>Uncle. Why are you dressed as a carpenter?</b>

04:26.491 --> 04:28.201
<b>Never mind, never mind.</b>

04:29.371 --> 04:31.291
<b>The preparations for the uprising
are complete.</b>

04:31.371 --> 04:33.661
<b>Now is the time to reveal my plan.</b>

04:34.831 --> 04:37.581
<b>They are young,
but they are retainers I can trust.</b>

04:38.171 --> 04:41.301
<b>May I show them as well, Sir Kinmune?</b>

04:42.761 --> 04:45.801
<b>If those children tell anyone,
you will die.</b>

04:45.881 --> 04:48.351
<b>If you trust them enough
to accept the consequences,</b>

04:48.431 --> 04:49.811
<b>then very well.</b>

04:49.891 --> 04:51.641
<b>SAIONJI VILLA</b>

04:51.721 --> 04:54.311
<b>This is the Saionji clan's
newly-built villa.</b>

04:54.851 --> 04:58.941
<b>I have been modifying this bathhouse
all by myself.</b>

05:00.481 --> 05:05.361
<b>We will hold a banquet at this villa
and invite the Emperor.</b>

05:05.451 --> 05:09.581
<b>We will suggest that he be the first
to bathe in the new bath,</b>

05:09.661 --> 05:12.451
<b>for good fortune,
and when he enters this changing room…</b>

05:22.551 --> 05:25.091
<b>The floor will open, and the Emperor
will plunge headfirst</b>

05:25.171 --> 05:26.171
<b>onto the blades below.</b>

05:26.681 --> 05:29.391
<b>Here, we shall put the Emperor to death.</b>

05:29.471 --> 05:32.431
<b>That will be the signal for us
to begin our war.</b>

05:35.061 --> 05:37.441
<b>After the fall of the Kamakura shogunate,</b>

05:37.521 --> 05:39.981
<b>the Emperor has openly treated
my Saionji clan unfavorably</b>

05:40.061 --> 05:41.611
<b>because of our close ties to the Hojo.</b>

05:42.401 --> 05:46.031
<b>Unless we take the Emperor's life
and restore the Hojo to power,</b>

05:46.111 --> 05:49.241
<b>I can never hope
to rise in rank in this lifetime.</b>

05:50.241 --> 05:52.531
<b>Are you two out of your minds?</b>

05:52.621 --> 05:57.621
<b>Even I know that killing the Emperor
is a grave crime and no laughing matter.</b>

05:58.961 --> 06:01.961
<b>We of the Kamakura faction
do not recognize the current Emperor</b>

06:02.041 --> 06:04.001
<b>as having legitimately
ascended the throne.</b>

06:04.501 --> 06:08.011
<b>Doing away with a false Emperor
does not constitute high treason.</b>

06:08.591 --> 06:11.761
<b>After all, the current regime
is the Emperor's dictatorship.</b>

06:11.851 --> 06:15.101
<b>Once it loses its head,
Kyo will fall into utter chaos.</b>

06:15.181 --> 06:17.731
<b>We will seize that opportunity
to raise armies across the country</b>

06:17.811 --> 06:19.351
<b>and reclaim the realm!</b>

06:23.821 --> 06:25.231
<b>Yes.</b>

06:25.321 --> 06:27.281
<b>I have a feeling
that if you continue with this plan,</b>

06:27.361 --> 06:29.861
<b>a golden temple will be built here.</b>

06:31.031 --> 06:33.161
<b>That is a favorable omen, shrine maiden!</b>

06:33.741 --> 06:37.541
<b>It means my clan will prosper enough
to build something like that!</b>

06:37.621 --> 06:40.671
<b>Indeed, Sir Kinmune!
We will carry out the plan in three days.</b>

06:40.751 --> 06:42.671
<b>Let us drink to its success in advance!</b>

06:46.961 --> 06:48.801
<b>We absolutely must stop them!</b>

06:48.881 --> 06:51.181
<b>Killing the Emperor
would be the worst possible move.</b>

06:51.261 --> 06:54.051
<b>Not only would our prospective allies
stay away,</b>

06:54.141 --> 06:56.681
<b>but the Hojo name would be disgraced
for a thousand years to come.</b>

06:56.771 --> 06:57.931
<b>My Lord!</b>

07:00.941 --> 07:02.731
<b>Thank goodness…</b>

07:03.611 --> 07:07.691
<b>Oh, no. I mean,
Mr. Yorishige told me before we left.</b>

07:08.821 --> 07:12.411
<b><i>I cannot yet tell you
what Lord Yasuie's plan is,</i></b>

07:12.491 --> 07:14.491
<b><i>but it will most certainly fail.</i></b>

07:14.581 --> 07:16.581
<b><i>I can see that future.</i></b>

07:17.161 --> 07:20.001
<b><i>However, even if the plan ends in failure,</i></b>

07:20.081 --> 07:22.831
<b><i>there is no doubt that Kyo
will fall into great chaos,</i></b>

07:23.381 --> 07:26.961
<b><i>and it is also certain that the chaos will
be ideal for starting the great battle.</i></b>

07:27.961 --> 07:29.881
<b><i>The Elusive Warriors' mission in Kyo</i></b>

07:29.971 --> 07:32.431
<b><i>is to take Lord Yasuie with you
after the plan fails</i></b>

07:32.511 --> 07:34.551
<b><i>and flee back to Shinano
as quickly as possible.</i></b>

07:35.101 --> 07:37.391
<b><i>From then on, speed will be everything.</i></b>

07:37.931 --> 07:41.061
<b><i>We will commence military operations
as soon as you arrive in Shinano.</i></b>

07:42.191 --> 07:43.561
<b>That's what he told me.</b>

07:44.651 --> 07:45.651
<b>I see.</b>

07:45.731 --> 07:49.071
<b>To get Uncle safely away,
we need to prepare thoroughly</b>

07:50.031 --> 07:52.571
<b>before the plan is carried out.</b>

07:53.161 --> 07:56.241
<b>The question is how we will escape
from Kyo.</b>

07:57.031 --> 07:59.491
<b>Starting tomorrow,
we will scout out our escape routes.</b>

07:59.581 --> 08:01.411
<b>What about Mima?</b>

08:01.501 --> 08:03.751
<b>We promised we'd spend time with her
again tomorrow.</b>

08:03.831 --> 08:05.791
<b>I'll go tell her we cannot make it.</b>

08:05.881 --> 08:10.341
<b>If honest Big Brother talks to her,
sharp Mima will see right through him.</b>

08:14.131 --> 08:17.261
<b>Big Brother came down with a fever
and is in bed.</b>

08:17.351 --> 08:19.101
<b>-Sorry.
-Oh.</b>

08:19.181 --> 08:21.481
<b>Maybe I dragged him around too much.</b>

08:21.561 --> 08:22.771
<b>Well, can't be helped.</b>

08:23.811 --> 08:25.231
<b>Hey, Shizuku.</b>

08:25.311 --> 08:27.401
<b>Who is the boy, really?</b>

08:27.481 --> 08:28.901
<b>Just as I told you,</b>

08:28.981 --> 08:31.111
<b>he's the son of the chief guard
at Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

08:31.191 --> 08:34.031
<b>His business here is finished,
so I think he'll be leaving Kyo soon.</b>

08:35.491 --> 08:37.781
<b>You're pretty hard to read yourself.</b>

08:37.871 --> 08:41.581
<b>And this is from Big Brother,
to thank you for showing us around.</b>

08:41.661 --> 08:43.541
<b>What? Really? What is it?</b>

08:43.621 --> 08:45.791
<b>Maybe a comb? A mirror?</b>

08:45.871 --> 08:47.321
<b>WE CAUGHT SOME BIG ONES,
SO PLEASE ENJOY THEM</b>

08:47.321 --> 08:48.791
<b>You country samurai.</b>

08:49.461 --> 08:50.551
<b>Yes!</b>

08:50.631 --> 08:53.011
<b>This street is excellent.</b>

08:53.091 --> 08:58.051
<b>There are few people here, day or night,
and plenty of broken walls to hide behind.</b>

08:58.141 --> 09:01.471
<b>Streets like this were ideal
for escaping in Kamakura too!</b>

09:02.641 --> 09:04.431
<b>The Young Lord sure looks lively.</b>

09:04.521 --> 09:06.811
<b>When it comes to escaping,
he's in his element, after all.</b>

09:06.901 --> 09:10.651
<b>Well! You like this escape route?</b>

09:10.731 --> 09:12.991
<b>You have a discerning eye.
I like it as well!</b>

09:13.781 --> 09:17.991
<b>A warrior should always keep escape routes
like this in mind,</b>

09:18.821 --> 09:22.701
<b>so that we can ensure the Emperor's escape
if bandits attack Kyo.</b>

09:25.621 --> 09:27.041
<b>Pardon me for being so sudden.</b>

09:30.501 --> 09:32.381
<b>Are you the son of a warrior
from around here?</b>

09:32.461 --> 09:34.671
<b>Oh, no. I'm just sightseeing.</b>

09:34.761 --> 09:36.721
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

09:37.681 --> 09:38.971
<b>Let's go, My Lord.</b>

09:39.051 --> 09:41.141
<b>He looks weak,
bowing and scraping like that,</b>

09:41.221 --> 09:43.061
<b>but he seems to be on the Emperor's side.</b>

09:43.141 --> 09:45.021
<b>It'll be trouble
if he gets suspicious of us.</b>

09:45.101 --> 09:46.731
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:46.811 --> 09:48.981
<b>-Shizuku, the map.
-Yes.</b>

09:49.561 --> 09:50.981
<b>The next place to check is…</b>

09:57.571 --> 10:00.491
<b>BOWING</b>

10:01.331 --> 10:04.661
<b>Creepy. He keeps bowing
and acting suspiciously.</b>

10:04.751 --> 10:08.121
<b><i>No. He's not just some suspicious man!</i></b>

10:11.381 --> 10:14.501
<b><i>By bobbing his head
and looking all around,</i></b>

10:14.591 --> 10:17.671
<b><i>he's taking three-dimensional measurements
from above, below, left and right!</i></b>

10:18.181 --> 10:21.801
<b><i>Our builds, postures, stride lengths
and distances from him!</i></b>

10:22.391 --> 10:24.061
<b><i>Even when his opponent is a child,</i></b>

10:24.141 --> 10:26.851
<b><i>he makes sure to assess them
so he can escape without fail.</i></b>

10:26.931 --> 10:29.191
<b><i>That's the stance of the elusive!</i></b>

10:30.771 --> 10:33.111
<b><i>To think he saw through it
at such a young age…</i></b>

10:33.191 --> 10:35.071
<b><i>The secrets of my elusiveness.</i></b>

10:36.821 --> 10:38.031
<b><i>-He's formidable.
-<i>He's formidable.</i></i></b>

10:41.621 --> 10:44.371
<b><i>-If this man and I…
-Were to face each other in earnest…</i></b>

10:44.451 --> 10:46.751
<b><i>-I might lose to him at escaping!
-<i>I might lose to him at escaping!</i></i></b>

10:48.461 --> 10:50.921
<b>What is this inexplicable tension?</b>

10:51.501 --> 10:52.501
<b>How do I put it?</b>

10:52.581 --> 10:55.251
<b>It feels like they're locked
in an incredibly sophisticated,</b>

10:55.341 --> 10:56.761
<b>yet incredibly pointless clash.</b>

10:59.221 --> 11:00.761
<b>Shall we introduce ourselves?</b>

11:01.931 --> 11:03.801
<b>No, you need not.</b>

11:03.891 --> 11:05.761
<b>It would be rude to ask
the name of a child</b>

11:05.851 --> 11:07.221
<b>who is scouting escape routes.</b>

11:09.771 --> 11:12.231
<b>My name is Masashige Kusunoki.</b>

11:12.311 --> 11:13.771
<b>MASASHIGE KUSUNOKI</b>

11:13.861 --> 11:16.821
<b>I'm merely an insignificant minor official
who started out as a local landholder.</b>

11:22.031 --> 11:22.981
<b>"GOD OF WAR"
MASASHIGE KUSUNOKI</b>

11:22.981 --> 11:25.471
<b><i>Masashige Kusunoki, the "God of War."</i></b>

11:25.911 --> 11:28.751
<b><i>With only a small force,
he repeatedly outmaneuvered</i></b>

11:28.831 --> 11:31.211
<b><i>and defeated the massive forces
of the Kamakura shogunate,</i></b>

11:31.751 --> 11:34.841
<b><i>becoming a driving force behind
Emperor Godaigo's rise to rule the realm.</i></b>

11:35.751 --> 11:38.961
<b><i>His military genius stands out
even in Japanese history,</i></b>

11:39.051 --> 11:42.681
<b><i>and he is a great hero
celebrated in countless legends.</i></b>

11:43.391 --> 11:44.431
<b>Let's go, My Lord.</b>

11:44.511 --> 11:45.681
<b>That man is trouble.</b>

11:45.761 --> 11:48.311
<b>If he learns who you really are,
it's all over.</b>

11:49.811 --> 11:53.441
<b>A man named Shokan
praised your military strategy.</b>

11:53.521 --> 11:55.111
<b>Shokan?</b>

11:57.571 --> 12:02.111
<b>You mean Shokan, that utterly bald,
dull-eyed, rotten scoundrel!</b>

12:02.201 --> 12:05.031
<b>I helped him escape by using a substitute
corpse to make it look like he had died.</b>

12:05.121 --> 12:06.581
<b>That takes me back!</b>

12:06.661 --> 12:08.371
<b>How is he doing now?</b>

12:08.451 --> 12:10.661
<b>I thought I killed him, but he survived.</b>

12:10.751 --> 12:11.831
<b>Big Brother!</b>

12:15.171 --> 12:17.711
<b>What an interesting child you are!</b>

12:17.791 --> 12:22.131
<b>He certainly was a great villain
who deserved to be killed,</b>

12:22.221 --> 12:25.511
<b>but for now, let me simply be glad
that he is still alive somewhere!</b>

12:26.511 --> 12:27.511
<b>So,</b>

12:28.561 --> 12:30.641
<b>what do you want from me?</b>

12:34.101 --> 12:38.571
<b>You just revealed information
that could put your life in danger.</b>

12:39.151 --> 12:43.451
<b>And like me, you place
the utmost importance on survival.</b>

12:44.361 --> 12:47.911
<b>That means there is something
you want from me, Masashige,</b>

12:47.991 --> 12:50.701
<b>enough that you would
deliberately open yourself up to me.</b>

12:51.541 --> 12:54.041
<b><i>I cannot suppress this sense
that we understand each other.</i></b>

12:54.831 --> 12:56.501
<b><i>Regardless of whether
we are enemies or allies,</i></b>

12:56.581 --> 12:59.091
<b><i>there is something I should learn
from this man.</i></b>

12:59.171 --> 13:00.251
<b>Was I wrong?</b>

13:01.421 --> 13:02.421
<b>Mr. Kusunoki.</b>

13:03.801 --> 13:05.511
<b>There are enemies I wish to defeat.</b>

13:06.341 --> 13:10.221
<b><i>They surpass us in military strategy,
skills and power.</i></b>

13:10.311 --> 13:13.311
<b><i>And I am not confident I can defeat them
just by running from them.</i></b>

13:13.851 --> 13:17.771
<b>You wish to know the secret
to how the weak can defeat the strong.</b>

13:19.731 --> 13:21.941
<b>Very well, suspicious boy.</b>

13:22.031 --> 13:24.991
<b>Do you have the courage
to come to my residence alone?</b>

13:27.431 --> 13:34.731
<b>MASASHIGE KUSUNOKI'S RESIDENCE</b>

13:27.691 --> 13:31.411
<b>-You think the Young Lord will be okay?
-Probably.</b>

13:31.491 --> 13:34.251
<b>I don't think he's the kind of person
who would set a trap for a child.</b>

13:36.751 --> 13:38.331
<b>Still, I am surprised.</b>

13:38.421 --> 13:40.541
<b>To think that Masashige Kusunoki,</b>

13:40.631 --> 13:42.671
<b>whose military renown resounds
throughout Japan,</b>

13:42.751 --> 13:46.681
<b>would be a man who, at times,
even comes across as servile.</b>

13:46.761 --> 13:48.011
<b>-Sneaky, snacky.
-Dear!</b>

13:49.181 --> 13:51.431
<b>You're sneaking bites
of the servants' meal again!</b>

13:51.511 --> 13:54.351
<b>Sorry. I was just feeling a little hungry…</b>

13:58.941 --> 14:00.271
<b>Who is this child?</b>

14:00.361 --> 14:02.361
<b>-Run!
-Wait!</b>

14:03.861 --> 14:06.151
<b>Do you run away from your wife too?</b>

14:07.151 --> 14:09.621
<b>Ever since I took it upon myself to raise
an army and caused her much hardship,</b>

14:09.701 --> 14:11.201
<b>I have not been able to stand up to her.</b>

14:11.871 --> 14:13.831
<b>The Kusunoki style
is to flee for the time being,</b>

14:13.911 --> 14:16.161
<b>then get back in her good graces
once she has calmed down.</b>

14:18.371 --> 14:19.881
<b>Now then, boy.</b>

14:19.961 --> 14:23.381
<b>You wanted to know
how the weak can defeat the strong.</b>

14:24.211 --> 14:26.841
<b>Then let us have a practice bout.</b>

14:27.381 --> 14:30.221
<b>Use the technique you think
gives you the best chance of winning.</b>

14:32.051 --> 14:34.471
<b>We shall exchange just one move each.</b>

14:34.561 --> 14:37.311
<b>Once I've seen that,
I should be able to offer some advice.</b>

14:38.641 --> 14:40.941
<b>Or are you afraid</b>

14:41.651 --> 14:44.781
<b>of my martial prowess
that defeated the massive Hojo army?</b>

14:48.451 --> 14:49.451
<b>I'm not afraid.</b>

14:59.001 --> 15:00.921
<b>Who taught you that technique?</b>

15:01.001 --> 15:03.461
<b>One of my retainers,
whose one eye is hidden.</b>

15:04.041 --> 15:07.261
<b>He teaches me various techniques
suited to me.</b>

15:07.341 --> 15:09.471
<b>You have a good teacher.</b>

15:10.471 --> 15:11.801
<b><i>When I raised an army</i></b>

15:11.891 --> 15:14.511
<b><i>and faced a Kamakura force
a hundred times the size of my own</i></b>

15:14.601 --> 15:17.181
<b><i>my men were nothing
but a makeshift group of amateurs.</i></b>

15:17.891 --> 15:20.771
<b><i>We were even lacking teachers
to instruct them in swordsmanship.</i></b>

15:21.481 --> 15:23.561
<b>How did we win?</b>

15:24.231 --> 15:27.031
<b>Allow me to show you the Kusunoki style.</b>

15:43.581 --> 15:45.291
<b>He blocked it with a rice ball?</b>

15:45.791 --> 15:46.801
<b><i>From your stance,</i></b>

15:46.881 --> 15:49.721
<b><i>I could tell it was an artery slash
performed while escaping.</i></b>

15:50.381 --> 15:53.011
<b><i>In other words,
a low-power, precision slash.</i></b>

15:53.591 --> 15:56.681
<b>All I need to do is keep it
from reaching an artery,</b>

15:56.761 --> 16:00.681
<b>so even this hard rice ball
is enough to serve as a shield.</b>

16:00.771 --> 16:03.191
<b>GRINNING</b>

16:03.271 --> 16:07.571
<b>I never imagined someone
would use a rice ball in a sword fight.</b>

16:09.531 --> 16:12.951
<b>Thinking that way already means
you're not very elusive.</b>

16:13.031 --> 16:15.071
<b>You are too fixated on
winning with a sword.</b>

16:17.661 --> 16:20.201
<b>If you focus solely on
winning with a sword,</b>

16:20.291 --> 16:22.501
<b>only those who are strong
with a sword can win.</b>

16:22.581 --> 16:24.961
<b>If you are focus solely on
winning with arrows,</b>

16:25.041 --> 16:27.671
<b>only the side with skilled archers
can win.</b>

16:34.841 --> 16:37.101
<b>The secret to how the weak
can defeat the strong</b>

16:37.181 --> 16:41.021
<b>is to escape from the cage
of preconceptions.</b>

16:42.021 --> 16:43.691
<b>Mr. Kusunoki?</b>

16:43.771 --> 16:46.861
<b>Those confined within that cage
have nowhere to escape,</b>

16:46.941 --> 16:49.481
<b>and can find no options
beyond those directly before them.</b>

16:50.031 --> 16:52.491
<b>Even if you cannot wield a sword properly,</b>

16:52.571 --> 16:54.951
<b>you can hollow out logs
and store rainwater in them</b>

16:55.031 --> 16:57.071
<b>to withstand a siege.</b>

16:57.781 --> 17:02.121
<b>Even if you cannot use arrows,
you can spread oil and burn ladders.</b>

17:02.911 --> 17:06.381
<b>Even a baby can defecate
and throw its own feces.</b>

17:07.331 --> 17:11.631
<b>Soldiers, weapons,
physical strength and skills for battle</b>

17:11.711 --> 17:14.341
<b>need only be brought to bear
for a single moment</b>

17:14.421 --> 17:16.801
<b>to defeat an enemy force
a hundred times larger.</b>

17:18.101 --> 17:22.181
<b>Common sense, tradition,
aesthetics, past successes, large forces.</b>

17:22.721 --> 17:25.891
<b>Those enclosed in such cages
are solid and strong,</b>

17:25.981 --> 17:27.861
<b>but when a gap between
the bars is exploited,</b>

17:27.941 --> 17:30.821
<b>they have no way out
and are utterly vulnerable.</b>

17:30.901 --> 17:32.571
<b>Then what should I do?</b>

17:32.651 --> 17:33.901
<b>It is simple.</b>

17:34.741 --> 17:37.911
<b>Preconceptions are illusions
created by the mind.</b>

17:37.991 --> 17:41.701
<b>Then it is also the human mind
that can dispel them.</b>

17:55.341 --> 17:58.391
<b>The weak must not be trapped in a cage.</b>

17:59.221 --> 18:03.181
<b>Even if they call you underhanded
or cowardly, flee with confidence.</b>

18:06.481 --> 18:09.481
<b>Why do birds look so free and magnificent?</b>

18:10.061 --> 18:13.901
<b>Because the entire sky is a place
for them to escape.</b>

18:14.781 --> 18:16.901
<b>Unbound and unconfined.</b>

18:16.991 --> 18:20.411
<b>Always traverse that vast, high,
magnificent place of escape.</b>

18:21.411 --> 18:23.581
<b>To escape is to live.</b>

18:23.661 --> 18:26.121
<b>That is what I, Masashige, believe.</b>

18:27.001 --> 18:29.251
<b>TO ESCAPE IS TO LIVE</b>

18:31.541 --> 18:34.171
<b>Thank you, Mr. Kusunoki!</b>

18:34.251 --> 18:37.381
<b>Your words have given me confidence
in escaping!</b>

18:37.471 --> 18:39.551
<b>People have said I have
the fighting ability of a rabbit</b>

18:39.641 --> 18:42.511
<b>and called me a naked little freak
who runs away.</b>

18:42.601 --> 18:44.391
<b>I've been hurt
by all the things they've called me!</b>

18:44.471 --> 18:46.811
<b>That's quite a way to be spoken of.</b>

18:46.891 --> 18:47.981
<b>Boy.</b>

18:48.771 --> 18:51.061
<b>Let me give you something nice.</b>

18:51.151 --> 18:53.441
<b>CLUTTERED</b>

18:53.521 --> 18:54.571
<b>What a mess…</b>

18:55.361 --> 18:57.491
<b>It got this way
while I was trying all sorts of things</b>

18:57.571 --> 18:59.401
<b>to see what might be useful in battle.</b>

19:01.071 --> 19:02.911
<b>-Here it is.
-What's that?</b>

19:03.531 --> 19:07.161
<b>It is a record
the Emperor ordered me to write.</b>

19:07.251 --> 19:13.631
<b>It describes how I fought the last war
and records it all.</b>

19:14.251 --> 19:16.631
<b>That is the draft of what I submitted.</b>

19:18.841 --> 19:20.301
<b>Your handwriting is awful!</b>

19:20.381 --> 19:21.641
<b>It's just a draft,</b>

19:21.721 --> 19:23.851
<b>and no one's going to see it,
so I thought, why not?</b>

19:23.931 --> 19:27.431
<b>Well, take your time deciphering it.</b>

19:27.521 --> 19:28.731
<b>Right…</b>

19:28.811 --> 19:32.101
<b>However, you must not show it to anyone.</b>

19:32.191 --> 19:34.731
<b>It is meant to be given
only to the Emperor.</b>

19:34.821 --> 19:36.071
<b>More importantly…</b>

19:38.071 --> 19:40.401
<b>these are military strategies
for those who love to escape.</b>

19:41.071 --> 19:44.321
<b>Someone who doesn't understand escape
may misuse them.</b>

19:46.081 --> 19:49.961
<b>I trust you as a fellow lover of escape
and entrust this to you.</b>

19:50.871 --> 19:52.331
<b>Do you understand, boy?</b>

19:53.961 --> 19:57.091
<b>Yes! Thank you, Mr. Masashige!</b>

19:58.381 --> 20:00.841
<b>He's out! Thank goodness!</b>

20:00.921 --> 20:03.011
<b>Thank you for giving me
your valuable time.</b>

20:03.591 --> 20:06.391
<b>I have had many valuable experiences
since coming to Kyo,</b>

20:06.471 --> 20:08.601
<b>but the time I spent with you today
was exceptional.</b>

20:09.271 --> 20:11.891
<b>Indeed. Life is short.</b>

20:11.981 --> 20:14.151
<b>Enjoy escaping to your heart's content.</b>

20:16.441 --> 20:19.611
<b><i>At his age,
to have eyes that carry such a destiny…</i></b>

20:20.491 --> 20:23.821
<b><i>And the hostility for the current regime
that occasionally shows through…</i></b>

20:25.031 --> 20:26.241
<b><i>Surely not.</i></b>

20:27.331 --> 20:28.331
<b>Father!</b>

20:30.041 --> 20:31.911
<b>What is it, Tamonmaru?</b>

20:32.001 --> 20:34.751
<b>A messenger from Lord Takauji came
while you were away.</b>

20:36.501 --> 20:38.131
<b>Regarding the banquet
the day after tomorrow,</b>

20:38.211 --> 20:40.631
<b>he says his arrival will be delayed
until around 8:00 p.m.</b>

20:41.301 --> 20:42.881
<b>I wonder if something has come up.</b>

20:42.971 --> 20:46.091
<b>He has some business to attend to
at the military office</b>

20:46.181 --> 20:48.351
<b>and will come directly here
as soon as he is finished.</b>

20:48.431 --> 20:49.641
<b>Understood.</b>

20:49.721 --> 20:52.391
<b>Also, Mother was looking for you.</b>

20:52.481 --> 20:54.441
<b>She still has not calmed down…</b>

20:54.521 --> 20:56.401
<b>I don't think she will for a while.</b>

20:57.611 --> 21:00.361
<b>I may have nothing
but pickled vegetables for dinner tonight.</b>

21:00.441 --> 21:02.821
<b>I will share some of mine with you.</b>

21:39.111 --> 21:40.571
<b>My Lord.</b>

21:40.651 --> 21:43.281
<b>I would very much like you
to accept my proposal this time.</b>

21:44.861 --> 21:47.911
<b>We now know when he will be passing by
and which route he will take.</b>

21:54.831 --> 21:58.041
<b><i>This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity
to kill Takauji.</i></b>

21:58.921 --> 22:00.291
<b><i>If you seek to rule the realm,</i></b>

22:00.961 --> 22:02.961
<b><i>this is not an opportunity
you should let pass.</i></b>

23:39.061 --> 23:39.941
<b>EPISODE 22 (YEAR 1335):
THE NIGHT OF THE ASSASSINATION</b>

23:39.061 --> 23:39.941
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
